@startuml
title S5  Open recipe details and read history  US-08 / US-14
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #172A3A
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowColor #345A72
skinparam Shadowing false
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam TitleFontColor #123A52
skinparam TitleFontSize 19
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #EDF5FA
skinparam ClassBorderColor #456F89
skinparam ComponentBackgroundColor #EDF5FA
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #456F89
skinparam PackageBorderColor #456F89
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #E6F4F0
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #417364
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #EDF5FA
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #617C8D
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
actor User
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "Protected routes" as API

participant RecipeViewService as View
participant "tx: UnitOfWork" as Tx
participant "recipes: RecipeRepository" as Recipes
participant "history: HistoryRepository" as History
User -> UI : open a recipe
UI -> API : GET /recipes/:id
ref over API : S8: obtain owner or end with 401
API -> View : open(owner, recipeId)
View -> View : validate recipe ID
alt invalid recipe ID
  View --> API : validation error
  API --> UI : 400
else valid recipe ID
  group Read recipe and record view in one transaction
    View -> Tx : begin(WRITE)
    View -> Recipes : findOwned(owner, recipeId)
    Recipes --> View : Recipe with ordered children, or null
    alt owned recipe exists
      View -> History : recordLatest(owner, recipeId, serverUTC)
      History --> View : completed
      View -> Tx : commit()
      Tx --> View : committed
    else no owned recipe
      View -> Tx : rollback()
      Tx --> View : rolled back
    end
  end
  alt committed view
    View --> API : Recipe
    API --> UI : 200 details; label minutes and kcal as estimates
  else no owned recipe
    View --> API : unavailable
    API --> UI : 404
  end
end
User -> UI : open viewed history
UI -> API : GET /history
ref over API : S8: obtain owner or end with 401
API -> View : history(owner)
View -> History : listRecent(owner)
History --> View : ViewedRecipe[] (newest first)
View --> API : ViewedRecipe[]
API --> UI : 200 [{recipe, lastViewedAt}]
@enduml
